# Cursor Rules - AgentVerse Repository

- Project: AgentVerse Autonomous AI Agent & ML Pipeline (HackIndia 2026)
- Author: Adarsh Pandey (@adarsh-pandey-cse)
- Environment: Python 3.9+ with virtualenv support
- Always run `python -m unittest discover tests` after modifying code.
- Deny reading or committing `.env` and `.env.*` files.
- Prefer Python standard library modules over new third-party dependencies.
- Follow PEP 8 style guidelines with strict type annotations.
